---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "紧急电话号码及在中国需要帮助时该怎么办";
const description = "Emergency numbers in China: 110 (police), 120 (ambulance), 119 (fire). Also: embassy contacts, lost passport steps, and emergency phrases.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/tips/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Tips
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
  <header class="mb-12">
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🛡️ 中国旅游小贴士</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
      Emergency Numbers in China<br class="hidden md:block" />& What to Do If You Need Help
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">如果你在访问期间出了问题，这就是该怎么办。</p>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
      <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
      <span>⏱️ 阅读7分钟</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
      <strong>三个数字拯救了中国的生命：</strong> <strong class="text-red-600">110</strong> (police), <strong class="text-red-600">120</strong> (ambulance), <strong class="text-red-600">119</strong> (fire). All have English-speaking operators. Save your embassy number before you arrive.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Table of Contents -->
  <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-3">
      <li><a href="#three-numbers" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📞 你需要的三个数字</a></li>
      <li><a href="#language-barrier" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🗣️ 如果你不会说中文怎么办</a></li>
      <li><a href="#embassy" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏛️ 您的大使馆或领事馆</a></li>
      <li><a href="#common-emergencies" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🆘 常见紧急情况的应对步骤</a></li>
      <li><a href="#emergency-phrases" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📝 手机上应保留的紧急短语</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <h2 id="three-numbers" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">📞</span> The Three Numbers You Need
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
        <div class="text-6xl font-extrabold text-red-600 mb-2">110</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">🚔 警察</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">对于任何紧急情况，即使你需要医疗帮助。他们可以帮你联系说英语的警察。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
        <div class="text-6xl font-extrabold text-blue-600 mb-2">120</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3">🚑 救护车</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">医疗急救热线。操作员可以安排英语口语协助。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
        <div class="text-6xl font-extrabold text-orange-600 mb-2">119</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-3">🚒 火</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">火灾紧急情况。用于任何与火灾有关的情况。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-12 not-prose">
      <p class="text-yellow-900 font-semibold">💡 <strong>紧急提示：</strong> If you can't speak, text your location to <strong>12110</strong> (emergency SMS service). Operators monitor this for people who can't make voice calls.</p>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <h2 id="language-barrier" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🗣️</span> What to Do If You Can't Speak Chinese
    </h2>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">这是紧急情况下最大的挑战。在你需要它之前，把这句话保存在你的手机上：</p>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <p class="text-2xl text-center mb-4">📱 <strong>将此保存到您的手机：</strong></p>
      <div class="bg-white text-gray-900 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-3">请帮我报警，我是外国人，需要翻译。</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-2"><em>（吴，吴，吴。）</em></p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 font-semibold">“请帮我报警。我是外国人，需要翻译。”</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <h2 id="embassy" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🏛️</span> Your Embassy or Consulate
    </h2>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">如果你丢失了护照，陷入法律纠纷，或者有严重的紧急情况，请联系你所在国家的大使馆或领事馆。</p>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
      <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">国家</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center">北京联系方式</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center">上海联系方式</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center">广州联系方式</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇺🇸 美国</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-8531-3000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-8011-2200</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-3814-5000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇬🇧 英国</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-5192-4000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-3279-2000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-8314-3000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇨🇦 加拿大</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-5139-4000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-3279-2800</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-8611-6100</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇦🇺 澳大利亚</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-5140-4111</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-2215-5200</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-3814-0111</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇩🇪 德国</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-8532-9000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-3401-0106</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-8313-0121</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇫🇷 法国</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-8531-2000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-6103-6300</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-2829-2000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇯🇵 日本</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-8531-9800</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-5257-4766</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-8334-3009</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇰🇷 韩国</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-8531-0700</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-6295-5000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-2919-2999</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇸🇬 新加坡</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-6505-9393</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-6278-5566</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-3891-2345</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-12"><em>⚠️ Embassy contact details can change and your country may not be listed in the table. <strong>请在旅行前查看您所在国家的官方大使馆网站。</strong></em></p>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 4 -->
    <h2 id="common-emergencies" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🆘</span> Steps for Common Emergencies
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">📘 护照丢失或被盗</h3>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li><strong>1.</strong> Call <strong>110</strong> or go to the nearest police station</li>
          <li><strong>2.</strong> Get a <strong>警方报告</strong> (报警回执 / bào jǐng huí zhí) — you need this for the embassy</li>
          <li><strong>3.</strong> Contact your embassy for an emergency travel document</li>
          <li><strong>4.</strong> Go to your embassy in person with the police report and a passport photo</li>
          <li><strong>5.</strong> Most embassies can issue an emergency passport within 1-5 business days</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">🏥 医疗急救</h3>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li><strong>1.</strong> Call <strong>120</strong> for an ambulance, or go directly to a hospital ER</li>
          <li><strong>2.</strong> Major public hospitals have <strong>国际部门</strong> with English-speaking staff</li>
          <li><strong>3.</strong> Call your travel insurance provider — they can help coordinate payment and find English-speaking doctors</li>
          <li><strong>4.</strong> If you can't communicate, show the hospital staff your passport and insurance card</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-4">💰 钱包丢了/没钱</h3>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li><strong>1.</strong> Go to the nearest <strong>警察局</strong> — they can help you contact your embassy</li>
          <li><strong>2.</strong> Go to any <strong>酒店</strong> — the front desk can help you call your embassy</li>
          <li><strong>3.</strong> Use WeChat/Alipay — they're accepted almost everywhere, even if your wallet is gone</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-4">📡 没有互联网</h3>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li><strong>1.</strong> Find a <strong>酒店大堂</strong> — any hotel will let you use their WiFi</li>
          <li><strong>2.</strong> <strong>星巴克或麦当劳</strong> — free WiFi available (ask staff for the password)</li>
          <li><strong>3.</strong> Go to a <strong>中国联通、中国移动或中国电信商店</strong> — they can help with SIM issues</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 5 -->
    <h2 id="emergency-phrases" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">📝</span> Emergency Phrases to Keep on Your Phone
    </h2>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
      <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">情况</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">发音</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">报警</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-red-600 font-bold text-lg">救命！</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>我需要医生</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">紧急电话：120</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-red-600 font-bold text-lg">报警</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>我需要救护车</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">我需要救护车</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-blue-600 font-bold text-lg">我需要救护车</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>我迷路了</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">音调</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-orange-600 font-bold text-lg">我迷路了</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>我感觉不舒服</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">我的护照被偷了</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-purple-600 font-bold text-lg">我感觉不舒服</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>我感觉不舒服（Wǒ gǎnjué bù shūfu）</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">医院在哪里？</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-red-600 font-bold text-lg">我的护照被偷了</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>你说什么？</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">带我来这里</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-blue-600 font-bold text-lg">最近的医院在哪里？</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>吴作霖</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">📚 相关指南</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-purple-600 font-bold text-lg">带我去这里</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>当地人的诚实回答</em></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />
  </div>

  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">VPN服务经常变化。没有单一官方来源。出行前请查询当前推荐。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li><a href="https://cs.mfa.gov.cn/gyls/lsgz/ztzl/lsbhyfwyjzx/202111/t20211101_10438739.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">当地人的诚实回答</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
  <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <a href="/zh/tips/is-china-safe/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">不要让骗子毁了你的旅行</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">紧急电话号码和该怎么办</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/zh/tips/common-scams/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国常见的骗局以及如何避免</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">不要让骗子毁了你的旅行</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/zh/medical/seeing-a-doctor/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">在中国看医生</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">医院、保险和预期情况</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
</Layout>